---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { playAsiaLink, cdJapanLink } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Why Japan Import Hub exists: making Japanese games and music accessible to everyone, everywhere.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="article-header">
      <h1>About Japan Import Hub</h1>
    </header>
    <article class="prose">
      <p>
        Importing from Japan used to feel like a members-only club: confusing shops, scary shipping
        fees, and the fear of ordering the wrong edition. We started Japan Import Hub with one belief —
        <strong>anyone, anywhere, should be able to enjoy Japanese games and music</strong>, whether
        you're a lifelong collector or buying your very first import CD.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every guide here is written in plain English, explains the <em>why</em> behind each step,
        and points you to trusted stores that ship worldwide with English checkout —
        primarily <a href={playAsiaLink('/')} rel="nofollow sponsored" target="_blank">Play-Asia</a> and
        <a href={cdJapanLink('/')} rel="nofollow sponsored" target="_blank">CDJapan</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>How we keep this free</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy through them, the store pays us a
        small commission — the price you pay never changes. That commission funds new guides,
        which stay free for everyone. See our full <a href="/disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
